<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH RPIX CLOSES LOWER IN THIN TRADING.</title>
<headline>CZECH RPIX CLOSES LOWER IN THIN TRADING.</headline>
<text>
<p>1200 GMT - The Czech RPIX closes down in thin trading on Tuesday.</p>
<p>*  .RPIX falls 9.2 points, 0.82 percent, to 1,119.5.</p>
<p>* Turnover, 11.7 million crowns.</p>
<p>* Komercni Banka drops 35 crowns to 2,215.</p>
<p>* CEZ drops 20 crowns to 1,010.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
